{"slug": "C_S03E11", "video_name": "Community - S03E11 - Urban Matrimony and the Sandwich Arts Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S03E11 - Urban Matrimony and the Sandwich Arts Bluray-1080p Proper.en.hi.srt", "duration_seconds": 1282.495, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "local", "stt_model": "ggml-small.en-q5_1.bin", "segment_count": 535, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 8.0, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 8.0, "end": 9.0, "text": "Mmm."}, {"start": 9.0, "end": 10.0, "text": "Ugh."}, {"start": 10.0, "end": 12.0, "text": "Hot and brown's coffee really wakes me up"}, {"start": 12.0, "end": 14.0, "text": "to the fact that it's coffee sucks."}, {"start": 14.0, "end": 16.0, "text": "I miss having a coffee shop."}, {"start": 16.0, "end": 17.0, "text": "Now where am I gonna get my cappuccinos"}, {"start": 17.0, "end": 19.0, "text": "and Sarah McLaughlin CDs?"}, {"start": 19.0, "end": 20.0, "text": "Wasn't that great?"}, {"start": 20.0, "end": 21.0, "text": "If I had this space,"}, {"start": 21.0, "end": 23.0, "text": "I would've served fresh fruit and sandwiches,"}, {"start": 23.0, "end": 24.0, "text": "and I would've got rid of that"}, {"start": 24.0, "end": 25.0, "text": "\"take a penny, leave a penny\" nonsense."}, {"start": 25.0, "end": 26.0, "text": "If the good Lord wanted you to have a penny,"}, {"start": 26.0, "end": 28.0, "text": "you'd have one."}, {"start": 28.0, "end": 30.0, "text": "Cheers."}, {"start": 30.0, "end": 32.0, "text": "Why do you look like a wealthy murderer?"}, {"start": 32.0, "end": 34.0, "text": "I look like an entrepreneur."}, {"start": 34.0, "end": 35.0, "text": "Now that my dad's gone,"}, {"start": 35.0, "end": 37.0, "text": "I'm expanding both our industries"}, {"start": 37.0, "end": 41.0, "text": "by investing in new products like..."}, {"start": 41.0, "end": 42.0, "text": "these."}, {"start": 42.0, "end": 43.0, "text": "What's that?"}, {"start": 43.0, "end": 44.0, "text": "It's an automatic security camera"}, {"start": 44.0, "end": 46.0, "text": "that can tell your friends from intruders."}, {"start": 46.0, "end": 47.0, "text": "How does it work?"}, {"start": 47.0, "end": 50.0, "text": "Your guests have arrived."}, {"start": 50.0, "end": 53.0, "text": "Threat level four."}, {"start": 53.0, "end": 55.0, "text": "Your guests have arrived."}, {"start": 55.0, "end": 56.0, "text": "It's not calibrated."}, {"start": 56.0, "end": 58.0, "text": "The future of the past is now."}, {"start": 58.0, "end": 60.0, "text": "Why don't you put your money into a good idea,"}, {"start": 60.0, "end": 61.0, "text": "like Shirley?"}, {"start": 61.0, "end": 62.0, "text": "Oh, I made that offer the first day I met her."}, {"start": 62.0, "end": 64.0, "text": "She almost broke my nose."}, {"start": 64.0, "end": 65.0, "text": "I mean, Shirley's good with food,"}, {"start": 65.0, "end": 66.0, "text": "you have capital,"}, {"start": 66.0, "end": 68.0, "text": "and Greendale has real estate."}, {"start": 68.0, "end": 69.0, "text": "What are you talking about, Britta?"}, {"start": 69.0, "end": 71.0, "text": "I'm talking about the whole reason you came here,"}, {"start": 71.0, "end": 73.0, "text": "to start a business."}, {"start": 73.0, "end": 74.0, "text": "What do you think, Shirley?"}, {"start": 74.0, "end": 77.0, "text": "Should I have my people call your people?"}, {"start": 77.0, "end": 79.0, "text": "I mean, not your people."}, {"start": 79.0, "end": 82.0, "text": "I could think about it."}, {"start": 82.0, "end": 84.0, "text": "Ooh."}, {"start": 84.0, "end": 88.0, "text": "It's Shirley Barre in the house."}, {"start": 88.0, "end": 92.0, "text": "The year was 1991."}, {"start": 92.0, "end": 93.0, "text": "Oh, it's great."}, {"start": 93.0, "end": 96.0, "text": "What are you doing here?"}, {"start": 96.0, "end": 97.0, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 101.0, "end": 103.0, "text": "It's Ring-Fling Dance."}, {"start": 103.0, "end": 107.0, "text": "That's where I first laid eyes on Shirley Edwards."}, {"start": 107.0, "end": 111.0, "text": "A vision in hyper color and hammer pants."}, {"start": 111.0, "end": 114.0, "text": "Figure, I have loved you ever since there was a Soviet Union"}, {"start": 114.0, "end": 116.0, "text": "and only one day in the winds."}, {"start": 116.0, "end": 118.0, "text": "Baby, I know I've made mistakes,"}, {"start": 118.0, "end": 121.0, "text": "but I'm so happy we've made it through."}, {"start": 121.0, "end": 124.0, "text": "But there is one thing, something important,"}, {"start": 124.0, "end": 127.0, "text": "that we keep putting off."}, {"start": 127.0, "end": 129.0, "text": "Will you, Shirley Bitt,"}, {"start": 129.0, "end": 133.0, "text": "marry me and Andre Bitt again?"}, {"start": 133.0, "end": 135.0, "text": "Yes, yes, again!"}, {"start": 142.0, "end": 145.0, "text": "Shall I notify authorities?"}, {"start": 171.0, "end": 173.0, "text": "It's cool that Andre and Shirley are getting married again."}, {"start": 173.0, "end": 175.0, "text": "There's a whole generation of viewers that didn't get to see the original."}, {"start": 175.0, "end": 177.0, "text": "Let's hope it's more of a bail than a Kilmer situation."}, {"start": 177.0, "end": 179.0, "text": "Second wedding is okay, I guess."}, {"start": 179.0, "end": 185.0, "text": "If I had to rank them, I'd have to go 4th, 7th, 2nd, 5th, 1st, 3rd, 6th."}, {"start": 185.0, "end": 185.7826086956522, "text": "No, wait."}, {"start": 185.7826086956522, "end": 187.0, "text": "1st, then 5th."}, {"start": 187.0, "end": 187.34146341463415, "text": "Got it."}, {"start": 187.34146341463415, "end": 189.0, "text": "4th, 7th, 2nd, 1st, 5th, 3rd, 6th."}, {"start": 189.0, "end": 192.0, "text": "When's our culture gonna outgrow this wedding thing?"}, {"start": 192.0, "end": 194.0, "text": "Is your anti-wedding now?"}, {"start": 194.0, "end": 195.0, "text": "No, she's just pro-ante."}, {"start": 195.0, "end": 197.0, "text": "Know to everything you both said."}, {"start": 197.0, "end": 199.0, "text": "Weddings are like little girls tea parties,"}, {"start": 199.0, "end": 201.0, "text": "except the women are the stuffed animals,"}, {"start": 201.0, "end": 203.0, "text": "the men are making them talk,"}, {"start": 203.0, "end": 204.0, "text": "and they're not drinking tea."}, {"start": 204.0, "end": 206.0, "text": "They're drinking antiquated gender roles."}, {"start": 206.0, "end": 208.0, "text": "Somebody tell Britta what an analogy is."}, {"start": 208.0, "end": 209.0, "text": "I know what it is."}, {"start": 209.0, "end": 212.0, "text": "It's like a thought with another thought's hat on."}, {"start": 215.335, "end": 217.335, "text": "Look, I can't get behind this marriage thing either."}, {"start": 217.335, "end": 220.335, "text": "It was invented back when, 'til death meant, 'til your first cold."}, {"start": 220.335, "end": 222.335, "text": "I mean, life's too long to spend it with someone else."}, {"start": 222.335, "end": 223.335, "text": "It's a sucker's game."}, {"start": 223.335, "end": 224.335, "text": "It's a mutual cop-out."}, {"start": 224.335, "end": 227.335, "text": "I mean, just nut up and die alone."}, {"start": 227.335, "end": 228.335, "text": "Hello!"}, {"start": 228.335, "end": 230.335, "text": "Oh my God, I'm so happy for you!"}, {"start": 230.335, "end": 232.335, "text": "I know, isn't it exciting?"}, {"start": 232.335, "end": 234.335, "text": "The rehearsal is in two days,"}, {"start": 234.335, "end": 236.335, "text": "and the wedding is the day after that on our anniversary,"}, {"start": 236.335, "end": 238.335, "text": "and I'm sure you all can make it because..."}, {"start": 238.335, "end": 239.335, "text": "You're already here."}, {"start": 239.335, "end": 241.335, "text": "You're having your wedding in study room?"}, {"start": 241.335, "end": 243.335, "text": "Our church has certain policies regarding things like"}, {"start": 243.335, "end": 247.335, "text": "second weddings and tight jeans and girl co-cats."}, {"start": 247.335, "end": 250.335, "text": "Um, Jeff, I was wondering if you would do us the honor"}, {"start": 250.335, "end": 251.335, "text": "of giving a toast at our wedding."}, {"start": 251.335, "end": 252.335, "text": "Good idea!"}, {"start": 252.335, "end": 255.335, "text": "Jeff has a lot of thoughts about marriage."}, {"start": 255.335, "end": 256.33500000000004, "text": "I would be honored."}, {"start": 256.33500000000004, "end": 258.33500000000004, "text": "Shirley, do you need any help with your wedding?"}, {"start": 258.33500000000004, "end": 260.9784615384616, "text": "This probably sounds silly, but every time I see a wedding"}, {"start": 260.9784615384616, "end": 263.07500000000005, "text": "idea, I, like, I put it in a little scrapbook."}, {"start": 263.07500000000005, "end": 264.67499999999995, "text": "Oh, that's nice."}, {"start": 264.67499999999995, "end": 265.663679245283, "text": "Oh, we can help too."}, {"start": 265.663679245283, "end": 268.2342452830188, "text": "We just saw the Inspector Spacetime wedding episode,"}, {"start": 268.2342452830188, "end": 269.91499999999996, "text": "so we know what pitfalls to avoid."}, {"start": 269.91499999999996, "end": 271.7813157894737, "text": "Be sure to get a DNA reading of your prospective mate,"}, {"start": 271.7813157894737, "end": 273.855, "text": "and Inspector Spacetime ended up marrying himself as a baby."}, {"start": 273.855, "end": 275.5929411764706, "text": "I think I got this."}, {"start": 275.5929411764706, "end": 280.07500000000005, "text": "Everyone just come and relax and behave normally."}, {"start": 280.07500000000005, "end": 281.14833333333337, "text": "Ugh!"}, {"start": 281.14833333333337, "end": 282.2216666666667, "text": "Ugh!"}, {"start": 282.2216666666667, "end": 283.295, "text": "Ugh!"}, {"start": 283.295, "end": 284.36833333333334, "text": "Ugh!"}, {"start": 284.36833333333334, "end": 285.44166666666666, "text": "Ugh!"}, {"start": 285.44166666666666, "end": 286.515, "text": "Ugh!"}, {"start": 286.515, "end": 287.9805172413793, "text": "That's noise that people make when they're offended"}, {"start": 287.9805172413793, "end": 289.015, "text": "and all the movies that Annie rents."}, {"start": 289.015, "end": 292.67499999999995, "text": "Well, try not to embarrass you at your community college library wedding."}, {"start": 292.67499999999995, "end": 293.375, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 293.375, "end": 295.7414, "text": "Oh, Shirley, I managed to set up a meeting with the"}, {"start": 295.7414, "end": 298.015, "text": "Dean, so we can pitch him our sandwich shop idea."}, {"start": 298.015, "end": 300.53855555555555, "text": "I've already registered a website."}, {"start": 300.53855555555555, "end": 301.355, "text": "It's, uh..."}, {"start": 301.355, "end": 307.02362385321106, "text": "http colon forward slash forward slash www period members"}, {"start": 307.02362385321106, "end": 312.19500000000005, "text": "period webplicity custom sites all one word period c"}, {"start": 312.19500000000005, "end": 313.15477011494255, "text": "Oh, I don't know, Pierce."}, {"start": 313.15477011494255, "end": 315.53499999999997, "text": "I'm way too busy for that now with the wedding and everything."}, {"start": 315.53499999999997, "end": 318.01326086956516, "text": "Goodbye, everybody."}, {"start": 318.01326086956516, "end": 321.53499999999997, "text": "I have to practice my walk."}, {"start": 321.53499999999997, "end": 322.12899999999996, "text": "Great."}, {"start": 322.12899999999996, "end": 326.188, "text": "Another business venture down the toilet."}, {"start": 326.188, "end": 327.277, "text": "No problem."}, {"start": 327.277, "end": 329.45500000000004, "text": "I've still got plan C."}, {"start": 329.45500000000004, "end": 336.21500000000003, "text": "Ladies and gentlemen, the trouser bench."}, {"start": 336.21500000000003, "end": 341.155, "text": "For the man on the go who makes frequent stops."}, {"start": 341.155, "end": 343.69500000000005, "text": "Will somebody please call all the ambulances?"}, {"start": 343.69500000000005, "end": 344.6312376237624, "text": "I can't believe Shirley."}, {"start": 344.6312376237624, "end": 347.635, "text": "We should show up at this wedding and be the most normal people in the world."}, {"start": 347.635, "end": 348.77013513513515, "text": "Yeah, I can go as normal, man."}, {"start": 348.77013513513515, "end": 350.43500000000006, "text": "And you can be my trusty sidekick ordinario."}, {"start": 350.43500000000006, "end": 350.731551724138, "text": "Huh?"}, {"start": 350.731551724138, "end": 350.95396551724144, "text": "No."}, {"start": 350.95396551724144, "end": 352.51086206896554, "text": "That's already weird."}, {"start": 352.51086206896554, "end": 354.735, "text": "We'd be playing into our hand."}, {"start": 354.735, "end": 360.67499999999995, "text": "We should just show up wearing boring gray suits with gray ties and gray shirts."}, {"start": 360.67499999999995, "end": 361.81651898734174, "text": "We could dye our hair gray."}, {"start": 361.81651898734174, "end": 364.015, "text": "Then we could lay down on sidewalk and be invisible."}, {"start": 364.015, "end": 365.615, "text": "You know, maybe Shirley's got a point."}, {"start": 365.615, "end": 366.5855882352941, "text": "I have an idea."}, {"start": 366.5855882352941, "end": 370.015, "text": "What if we purged all the weirdness from our systems?"}, {"start": 370.015, "end": 372.8601923076923, "text": "You mean a full 24 hour weird down in the Dreamatorium."}, {"start": 372.8601923076923, "end": 375.395, "text": "Just you, me and our imaginations, no restraints."}, {"start": 375.395, "end": 378.53499999999997, "text": "By the wedding, our temptation to act weird will be gone."}, {"start": 378.53499999999997, "end": 380.1734, "text": "I'm feeling more normal already."}, {"start": 380.1734, "end": 381.095, "text": "Could I walk home?"}, {"start": 381.095, "end": 382.4075, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 382.4075, "end": 385.29499999999996, "text": "All righty."}, {"start": 385.29499999999996, "end": 388.4806074766355, "text": "Shirley, my ninth grade English teacher used to say there"}, {"start": 388.4806074766355, "end": 391.275, "text": "will always be a reason not to follow your dreams."}, {"start": 391.275, "end": 395.91499999999996, "text": "At the time, he meant I was under the age of consent, but his words still apply."}, {"start": 395.91499999999996, "end": 399.615, "text": "Are you sure your wedding is the reason you're bailing on this business with Pierce?"}, {"start": 399.615, "end": 401.8204054054054, "text": "Uh, in the words of my ninth grade English teacher,"}, {"start": 401.8204054054054, "end": 404.41499999999996, "text": "you are dipping and dapping and don't know what's happening."}, {"start": 404.41499999999996, "end": 404.65425233644856, "text": "Fine."}, {"start": 404.65425233644856, "end": 406.08976635514017, "text": "We both went to public school."}, {"start": 406.08976635514017, "end": 409.53499999999997, "text": "It's just that I don't want to see you slide into your old comfort zone."}, {"start": 409.53499999999997, "end": 410.9635714285714, "text": "You don't know that."}, {"start": 410.9635714285714, "end": 413.53499999999997, "text": "I am going to start a business soon."}, {"start": 413.53499999999997, "end": 416.83500000000004, "text": "I can't help it if I have floral arrangements to pick and a DJ to hire."}, {"start": 416.83500000000004, "end": 422.33500000000004, "text": "Shirley, if that really is your excuse, I will plan your wedding for you."}, {"start": 422.33500000000004, "end": 424.66071428571433, "text": "Oh, thank you."}, {"start": 424.66071428571433, "end": 427.3186734693878, "text": "Oh, my good God."}, {"start": 427.3186734693878, "end": 430.475, "text": "Thank you for that."}, {"start": 430.475, "end": 432.57500000000005, "text": "I was serious."}, {"start": 432.57500000000005, "end": 433.81500000000005, "text": "Where do you end up letting my wedding?"}, {"start": 437.826, "end": 438.886, "text": "What if Annie helps?"}, {"start": 438.886, "end": 439.69018604651166, "text": "Oh, hey, guys."}, {"start": 439.69018604651166, "end": 443.826, "text": "Did someone say Annie help wedding and something about maybe hydrangeas?"}, {"start": 443.826, "end": 446.766, "text": "Shirley, you can lie to yourself, but you can't lie to me."}, {"start": 446.766, "end": 451.366, "text": "Do not use your second wedding as an excuse to limit yourself."}, {"start": 451.366, "end": 453.0570526315789, "text": "Pierce, come here."}, {"start": 453.0570526315789, "end": 458.50600000000003, "text": "Shirley, do you take this man to be your business partner?"}, {"start": 458.50600000000003, "end": 459.546, "text": "I guess."}, {"start": 459.546, "end": 459.90497435897436, "text": "Sure."}, {"start": 459.90497435897436, "end": 462.346, "text": "I'd show the trouser bench anyway."}, {"start": 462.346, "end": 467.746, "text": "There are still some parts of the prototype that need to be extracted."}, {"start": 467.746, "end": 472.4869836065574, "text": "Maybe you're misunderstanding."}, {"start": 472.4869836065574, "end": 475.80567213114756, "text": "I mean, from my butt."}, {"start": 475.80567213114756, "end": 477.386, "text": "Excuse me."}, {"start": 477.386, "end": 478.32658823529414, "text": "Meet Shirley."}, {"start": 478.32658823529414, "end": 482.306, "text": "She's modern, she's urban, she's fun, and she's hungry."}, {"start": 482.306, "end": 485.2486086956522, "text": "You probably notice she's black, but not a stereotype."}, {"start": 485.2486086956522, "end": 486.06600000000003, "text": "Suburban black."}, {"start": 486.06600000000003, "end": 487.446, "text": "Is she suburban or urban?"}, {"start": 487.446, "end": 488.6306875, "text": "She's half urban."}, {"start": 488.6306875, "end": 491.906, "text": "Let's say, if I had her secret, if I had pitch,"}, {"start": 491.906, "end": 494.486, "text": "your father's a record producer or mother's a chorale."}, {"start": 494.486, "end": 496.906, "text": "We're supposed to be preparing a business pitch."}, {"start": 496.906, "end": 498.5625625, "text": "What about revenue projections?"}, {"start": 498.5625625, "end": 500.326, "text": "What are the margins going to be?"}, {"start": 500.326, "end": 507.166, "text": "Shirley, Shirley, Shirley, Shirley, Shirley, Shirley, sweet, innocent Shirley."}, {"start": 507.166, "end": 508.626, "text": "What was the question?"}, {"start": 508.626, "end": 511.926, "text": "Look, this was Britta's stupid idea."}, {"start": 511.926, "end": 513.626, "text": "I'd rather be with my man planning my wedding,"}, {"start": 513.626, "end": 516.9259999999999, "text": "and you'd clearly rather be with Halle Berry in 1999."}, {"start": 516.9259999999999, "end": 520.266, "text": "Pleasure not doing business with you."}, {"start": 520.266, "end": 526.186, "text": "Shirley, Hawthorne Wipes fired me."}, {"start": 526.186, "end": 529.806, "text": "They were just waiting for my dad to be out of the picture."}, {"start": 529.806, "end": 532.0407540983607, "text": "I'm not an entrepreneur."}, {"start": 532.0407540983607, "end": 535.486, "text": "I'm just a kid with a bunch of money."}, {"start": 535.486, "end": 538.511, "text": "Please, please help me be somebody."}, {"start": 538.511, "end": 540.326, "text": "Let me invest in you."}, {"start": 546.326, "end": 549.326, "text": "First thing we need to figure out is our overhead."}, {"start": 549.326, "end": 551.1044, "text": "-Do you have a pen?"}, {"start": 551.1044, "end": 551.666, "text": "-Yeah."}, {"start": 555.926, "end": 557.9171111111111, "text": "-Do you know someone that can buy a pen?"}, {"start": 557.9171111111111, "end": 558.166, "text": "-Yes."}, {"start": 558.166, "end": 561.506, "text": "Well, have you thought about the color story for your wedding?"}, {"start": 561.506, "end": 562.9696363636364, "text": "-He means the theme of the wedding."}, {"start": 562.9696363636364, "end": 563.4714545454545, "text": "Right, Dale?"}, {"start": 563.4714545454545, "end": 563.806, "text": "-Mm-hmm."}, {"start": 563.806, "end": 567.686, "text": "The same theme as every wedding, conformity, blind participation, and patriarchal--"}, {"start": 567.686, "end": 568.4340000000001, "text": "-What about pink?"}, {"start": 568.4340000000001, "end": 569.446, "text": "-We don't call it pink."}, {"start": 569.446, "end": 571.0369090909091, "text": "We don't call anything by its name."}, {"start": 571.0369090909091, "end": 572.946, "text": "That's, like, day one floral school stuff."}, {"start": 572.946, "end": 573.8602857142857, "text": "This is citrine."}, {"start": 573.8602857142857, "end": 574.946, "text": "This is opalescent."}, {"start": 574.946, "end": 577.526, "text": "This is sea glass, cameo, and cerulean."}, {"start": 577.526, "end": 578.3526666666667, "text": "Come on."}, {"start": 578.3526666666667, "end": 580.626, "text": "How difficult is this?"}, {"start": 580.626, "end": 586.706, "text": "These, these, these, this one, this one, and, like, stick a ribbon on it."}, {"start": 586.706, "end": 588.166, "text": "Happy?"}, {"start": 590.166, "end": 592.666, "text": "Britta, that's a really beautiful arrangement."}, {"start": 592.666, "end": 594.389137254902, "text": "You can color me lavender."}, {"start": 594.389137254902, "end": 596.046, "text": "Lavender means impressed."}, {"start": 596.046, "end": 597.2460000000001, "text": "Yeah, well, great."}, {"start": 597.2460000000001, "end": 599.046, "text": "Flowers look good in a pot."}, {"start": 599.046, "end": 601.086, "text": "There are people dying in Uganda."}, {"start": 603.086, "end": 604.0904444444444, "text": "-Got it."}, {"start": 604.0904444444444, "end": 605.346, "text": "-(screams)"}, {"start": 605.346, "end": 607.346, "text": "(screams)"}, {"start": 612.766, "end": 614.782129032258, "text": "-Well, that should do it."}, {"start": 614.782129032258, "end": 615.266, "text": "-Yeah."}, {"start": 615.266, "end": 617.266, "text": "My God, isn't tonight Shirley's wedding rehearsal?"}, {"start": 617.266, "end": 618.3044615384615, "text": "-Look at how we're dressed."}, {"start": 618.3044615384615, "end": 619.266, "text": "-Yes, it simply won't do."}, {"start": 619.266, "end": 621.766, "text": "Let's change into something appropriate for the occasion and be on our way."}, {"start": 621.766, "end": 623.366, "text": "I agree."}, {"start": 623.366, "end": 624.366, "text": "-Try not to be normal."}, {"start": 624.366, "end": 625.366, "text": "-Try not to be normal."}, {"start": 630.346, "end": 632.946, "text": "Annie, I need your help."}, {"start": 634.946, "end": 637.986, "text": "Um, you're like sentimental and stuff."}, {"start": 637.986, "end": 639.946, "text": "I'm really having trouble coming up with the toast."}, {"start": 639.946, "end": 641.268, "text": "I find that hard to believe, Jeff."}, {"start": 641.268, "end": 644.268, "text": "You once convinced Troy that turtlenecks were made of turtlenecks."}, {"start": 644.268, "end": 644.768, "text": "It's true."}, {"start": 644.768, "end": 648.268, "text": "My superpower is that I can assume any position that suits my purpose."}, {"start": 648.268, "end": 651.268, "text": "In that example, keeping turtlenecks has an option for myself down the road."}, {"start": 651.268, "end": 653.268, "text": "But I do have a kryptonite."}, {"start": 653.268, "end": 657.268, "text": "It's so obvious to me that marriage is dumb, I can't even pretend to get behind it."}, {"start": 657.268, "end": 659.268, "text": "You know what I think would make the perfect toast?"}, {"start": 659.268, "end": 664.268, "text": "You, as Shirley's friend, and a good guy just saying what's really in your heart."}, {"start": 664.268, "end": 666.268, "text": "There's something real in there."}, {"start": 667.268, "end": 669.268, "text": "Maybe that's what scares you."}, {"start": 672.268, "end": 674.268, "text": "I could use a drink."}, {"start": 674.268, "end": 677.268, "text": "Shirley's sandwiches can offer students more food for less money,"}, {"start": 677.268, "end": 680.268, "text": "and provide the campus with a higher percentage of the profits."}, {"start": 682.9219999999999, "end": 683.9219999999999, "text": "Here, split up the next line."}, {"start": 683.9219999999999, "end": 685.9219999999999, "text": "That's me!"}, {"start": 685.9219999999999, "end": 687.9219999999999, "text": "Where'd I get all that money I'm holding?"}, {"start": 687.9219999999999, "end": 689.8679459459458, "text": "I'm going to tell you the three reasons that Shirley's"}, {"start": 689.8679459459458, "end": 691.9219999999999, "text": "sandwiches and your cafeteria are going to be successful."}, {"start": 691.9219999999999, "end": 693.9219999999999, "text": "Well, then I'm writing this down."}, {"start": 693.9219999999999, "end": 695.9219999999999, "text": "Wait."}, {"start": 697.9219999999999, "end": 699.9219999999999, "text": "Well, then, I'm writing this down."}, {"start": 699.9219999999999, "end": 703.9219999999999, "text": "Wait."}, {"start": 703.9219999999999, "end": 704.9219999999999, "text": "Here's a pen."}, {"start": 704.9219999999999, "end": 706.9219999999999, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 714.9219999999999, "end": 716.9219999999999, "text": "Holy crap!"}, {"start": 716.9219999999999, "end": 718.9219999999999, "text": "Britta, you're really good at this."}, {"start": 718.9219999999999, "end": 719.9219999999999, "text": "I know."}, {"start": 719.9219999999999, "end": 720.9219999999999, "text": "What's wrong with you?"}, {"start": 720.9219999999999, "end": 724.9219999999999, "text": "This may shock you, Annie, but I come from a long line of wives and mothers."}, {"start": 724.9219999999999, "end": 725.9219999999999, "text": "Many do."}, {"start": 725.9219999999999, "end": 727.9219999999999, "text": "But I ran away from it my whole life."}, {"start": 727.9219999999999, "end": 729.9851578947367, "text": "I refuse to give Santa a Christmas list because I"}, {"start": 729.9851578947367, "end": 731.9219999999999, "text": "didn't want to depend on any man for anything."}, {"start": 731.9219999999999, "end": 733.9219999999999, "text": "And now look at me."}, {"start": 733.9219999999999, "end": 734.9219999999999, "text": "I'm Betty Crocker."}, {"start": 734.9219999999999, "end": 735.9219999999999, "text": "I'm Martha Stewart."}, {"start": 735.9219999999999, "end": 737.9219999999999, "text": "I'm one of the Steppenwolf wives."}, {"start": 737.9219999999999, "end": 739.9219999999999, "text": "Oh, God."}, {"start": 739.9219999999999, "end": 742.9219999999999, "text": "I'm going to make some man very happy someday."}, {"start": 742.9219999999999, "end": 743.3430526315789, "text": "Ooh."}, {"start": 743.3430526315789, "end": 743.8693684210525, "text": "Easy."}, {"start": 743.8693684210525, "end": 744.9219999999999, "text": "Slow down."}, {"start": 744.9219999999999, "end": 745.9219999999999, "text": "What's with you guys?"}, {"start": 745.9219999999999, "end": 746.9219999999999, "text": "We do whimsified ourselves."}, {"start": 746.9219999999999, "end": 747.3029523809523, "text": "Yep."}, {"start": 747.3029523809523, "end": 748.9219999999999, "text": "We're normal now."}, {"start": 748.9219999999999, "end": 749.6719999999999, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 749.6719999999999, "end": 750.9219999999999, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 750.9219999999999, "end": 752.9219999999999, "text": "Hey, anybody seen Shirley?"}, {"start": 752.9219999999999, "end": 753.9219999999999, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 753.9219999999999, "end": 754.9219999999999, "text": "Shirley's late to the rehearsal for her wedding?"}, {"start": 754.9219999999999, "end": 755.9219999999999, "text": "Oh, my."}, {"start": 755.9219999999999, "end": 756.1867058823528, "text": "Hey, man."}, {"start": 756.1867058823528, "end": 756.9219999999999, "text": "You know to be sarcastic."}, {"start": 756.9219999999999, "end": 757.9219999999999, "text": "I'm not being sarcastic."}, {"start": 757.9219999999999, "end": 759.9219999999999, "text": "We're heavily invested in your situation."}, {"start": 759.9219999999999, "end": 762.9219999999999, "text": "Nothing's more important to us than your second wedding's rehearsal going smoothly."}, {"start": 762.9219999999999, "end": 764.9219999999999, "text": "Walk away, man."}, {"start": 770.9219999999999, "end": 771.1978620689654, "text": "Hey."}, {"start": 771.1978620689654, "end": 772.9219999999999, "text": "Did you think of a toast?"}, {"start": 772.9219999999999, "end": 773.9219999999999, "text": "Well, yeah."}, {"start": 773.9219999999999, "end": 777.7480869565217, "text": "I had a drink, and I looked in my"}, {"start": 777.7480869565217, "end": 781.9219999999999, "text": "heart, and here's what I got so far."}, {"start": 781.9219999999999, "end": 782.9219999999999, "text": "Webster's dictionary defines--"}, {"start": 782.9219999999999, "end": 783.9219999999999, "text": "Stop!"}, {"start": 783.9219999999999, "end": 784.9219999999999, "text": "Stop!"}, {"start": 784.9219999999999, "end": 786.9219999999999, "text": "Webster's dictionary defines?"}, {"start": 786.9219999999999, "end": 788.9219999999999, "text": "That's the Jim Belushi of speech openings."}, {"start": 788.9219999999999, "end": 791.9219999999999, "text": "It accomplishes nothing, but everyone keeps using it, and nobody understands why."}, {"start": 791.9219999999999, "end": 792.1005714285714, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 792.1005714285714, "end": 792.9219999999999, "text": "Well, that's all I got."}, {"start": 792.9219999999999, "end": 795.9219999999999, "text": "That took me eight hours and six McAllen-nieces."}, {"start": 795.9219999999999, "end": 796.5750612244897, "text": "Look, I'm sorry."}, {"start": 796.5750612244897, "end": 797.9219999999999, "text": "I just don't believe in marriage."}, {"start": 797.9219999999999, "end": 798.6362857142856, "text": "I do."}, {"start": 798.6362857142856, "end": 800.9219999999999, "text": "It's inevitable."}, {"start": 800.9219999999999, "end": 804.9219999999999, "text": "And then I put a counter across here, and the oven's there."}, {"start": 804.9219999999999, "end": 805.9219999999999, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 805.9219999999999, "end": 806.9219999999999, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 806.9219999999999, "end": 809.9219999999999, "text": "And how fiscal will the quarterly earnings be?"}, {"start": 809.9219999999999, "end": 810.9219999999999, "text": "Well, initially, the fiscal--"}, {"start": 810.9219999999999, "end": 811.2161176470587, "text": "Wait."}, {"start": 811.2161176470587, "end": 812.9219999999999, "text": "That question makes no sense."}, {"start": 812.9219999999999, "end": 813.2779322033897, "text": "I know."}, {"start": 813.2779322033897, "end": 815.9219999999999, "text": "I just want to sound as good at business as you are."}, {"start": 815.9219999999999, "end": 817.9455294117646, "text": "I probably shouldn't say this, but I cannot"}, {"start": 817.9455294117646, "end": 819.9219999999999, "text": "believe you learned all this at Greendale."}, {"start": 819.9219999999999, "end": 821.9219999999999, "text": "You're very professional."}, {"start": 821.9219999999999, "end": 823.9219999999999, "text": "I am, aren't I?"}, {"start": 823.9219999999999, "end": 826.9219999999999, "text": "I brought sodas so we can toast to our futures."}, {"start": 826.9219999999999, "end": 828.9219999999999, "text": "Look at me now, Dad."}, {"start": 828.9219999999999, "end": 829.676716981132, "text": "Dad, oh, my God."}, {"start": 829.676716981132, "end": 831.7050188679244, "text": "I'm supposed to be looking like a bride for"}, {"start": 831.7050188679244, "end": 833.9219999999999, "text": "my wedding rehearsal to the dad of my children."}, {"start": 833.9219999999999, "end": 835.9219999999999, "text": "I'm coming, baby."}, {"start": 835.9219999999999, "end": 838.9219999999999, "text": "That was an odd dot to connect."}, {"start": 838.9219999999999, "end": 844.9219999999999, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 844.9219999999999, "end": 846.9219999999999, "text": "Give me another."}, {"start": 846.9219999999999, "end": 851.9219999999999, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 851.9219999999999, "end": 853.9219999999999, "text": "What's with you?"}, {"start": 853.9219999999999, "end": 855.9219999999999, "text": "This is who I am."}, {"start": 855.9219999999999, "end": 857.4219999999999, "text": "Andre, sorry I'm late."}, {"start": 857.4219999999999, "end": 858.9219999999999, "text": "I have wonderful news."}, {"start": 858.9219999999999, "end": 859.9219999999999, "text": "Where were you?"}, {"start": 859.9219999999999, "end": 861.3594999999999, "text": "Getting wonderful news."}, {"start": 861.3594999999999, "end": 862.9219999999999, "text": "The dean loved our pitch."}, {"start": 862.9219999999999, "end": 863.9219999999999, "text": "Your pitch?"}, {"start": 863.9219999999999, "end": 865.9219999999999, "text": "Woman, I've been waiting for you for two hours."}, {"start": 865.9219999999999, "end": 866.2553333333333, "text": "Oh, no."}, {"start": 866.2553333333333, "end": 867.3029523809523, "text": "Has it been that long?"}, {"start": 867.3029523809523, "end": 867.9219999999999, "text": "I'm so sorry."}, {"start": 867.9219999999999, "end": 869.9219999999999, "text": "Don't you dare use your sexy voice on me."}, {"start": 869.9219999999999, "end": 871.9219999999999, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 871.9219999999999, "end": 873.1442222222221, "text": "It's just a rehearsal."}, {"start": 873.1442222222221, "end": 874.9219999999999, "text": "Lord knows we've done it before."}, {"start": 874.9219999999999, "end": 876.9219999999999, "text": "That's not the point."}, {"start": 876.9219999999999, "end": 879.1691910112359, "text": "Shirley, I thought this wedding was supposed to be"}, {"start": 879.1691910112359, "end": 880.9219999999999, "text": "the start of us getting back to normal."}, {"start": 880.9219999999999, "end": 881.9219999999999, "text": "Back to normal?"}, {"start": 881.9219999999999, "end": 882.1442222222221, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 882.1442222222221, "end": 883.2553333333332, "text": "I need to not be Mr."}, {"start": 883.2553333333332, "end": 883.9219999999999, "text": "Mom anymore."}, {"start": 883.9219999999999, "end": 886.1124761904761, "text": "Okay, I got to get back to my stereo business."}, {"start": 886.1124761904761, "end": 887.9219999999999, "text": "You know my store has been struggling."}, {"start": 887.9219999999999, "end": 889.0187741935483, "text": "I'm sorry, Andre."}, {"start": 889.0187741935483, "end": 891.9219999999999, "text": "But normal went out the door the day you did."}, {"start": 891.9219999999999, "end": 893.603818181818, "text": "Well, if we can't get back to the way"}, {"start": 893.603818181818, "end": 895.9219999999999, "text": "things were, why the hell are we getting remarried?"}, {"start": 895.9219999999999, "end": 901.9219999999999, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 901.9219999999999, "end": 903.9219999999999, "text": "Oh, yeah."}, {"start": 903.9219999999999, "end": 906.9219999999999, "text": "These shrimp are to die for."}, {"start": 906.9219999999999, "end": 913.9219999999999, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 913.9219999999999, "end": 915.9219999999999, "text": "Walk the clique."}, {"start": 915.9219999999999, "end": 918.5932328767122, "text": "I think you've mistaken us for pirates."}, {"start": 918.5932328767122, "end": 920.9219999999999, "text": "We are community college students."}, {"start": 920.9219999999999, "end": 922.9219999999999, "text": "I bet I just had an odd thought."}, {"start": 922.9219999999999, "end": 925.0108888888888, "text": "What if once you go from being weird to normal,"}, {"start": 925.0108888888888, "end": 926.9219999999999, "text": "you can never go back to being weird again?"}, {"start": 926.9219999999999, "end": 927.9219999999999, "text": "That is an odd thought."}, {"start": 927.9219999999999, "end": 928.9219999999999, "text": "Well, let's hope it's the last."}, {"start": 928.9219999999999, "end": 930.9219999999999, "text": "Cheers to that, my everyday friend."}, {"start": 932.9219999999999, "end": 934.064857142857, "text": "Hello, everyone."}, {"start": 934.064857142857, "end": 937.9219999999999, "text": "Shirley asked me to say something nice at her wedding."}, {"start": 937.9219999999999, "end": 938.9219999999999, "text": "This is the rehearsal."}, {"start": 938.9219999999999, "end": 939.7219999999999, "text": "Shut up, Leonard."}, {"start": 939.7219999999999, "end": 942.9219999999999, "text": "Those teenage girls you play ping pong with are doing it ironically."}, {"start": 942.9219999999999, "end": 949.9219999999999, "text": "Well, I searched my heart for something nice to say at a wedding,"}, {"start": 949.9219999999999, "end": 954.9219999999999, "text": "and I found nothing, so I had a drink, and then I looked real hard."}, {"start": 954.9219999999999, "end": 956.9219999999999, "text": "And you know what I found?"}, {"start": 956.9219999999999, "end": 960.9219999999999, "text": "My daddy said he would stay with my mommy forever, and he left."}, {"start": 963.6859999999999, "end": 964.9459999999999, "text": "Marriage is a lie."}, {"start": 964.9459999999999, "end": 966.5559999999999, "text": "Nobody commits to this."}, {"start": 966.5559999999999, "end": 970.6859999999999, "text": "Nobody stays with anybody forever, so why do we keep lying?"}, {"start": 970.6859999999999, "end": 973.1944745762711, "text": "I'm gonna stay with somebody forever."}, {"start": 973.1944745762711, "end": 974.6859999999999, "text": "It's in my stupid DNA."}, {"start": 974.6859999999999, "end": 978.6859999999999, "text": "I was born to be a wife, and that's all I'm ever gonna be."}, {"start": 978.6859999999999, "end": 980.6859999999999, "text": "You expect anyone here to believe that?"}, {"start": 980.6859999999999, "end": 983.6859999999999, "text": "I don't care if anybody believes that Jackass hits a fact."}, {"start": 983.6859999999999, "end": 984.6859999999999, "text": "Prove it, Ding Dong!"}, {"start": 984.6859999999999, "end": 986.6627441860464, "text": "There are a lot of layers to this."}, {"start": 986.6627441860464, "end": 989.6859999999999, "text": "It's almost too conceptual to follow, but I love it."}, {"start": 989.6859999999999, "end": 991.5496363636363, "text": "So that's what this was all about, Andre."}, {"start": 991.5496363636363, "end": 993.6859999999999, "text": "It's just about wanting me back in the kitchen."}, {"start": 993.6859999999999, "end": 995.6859999999999, "text": "I thought you loved being a wife and a mother."}, {"start": 995.6859999999999, "end": 997.6859999999999, "text": "Of course, but can't you see that's not all I'm about anymore?"}, {"start": 997.6859999999999, "end": 998.1354382022471, "text": "Hi, sorry."}, {"start": 998.1354382022471, "end": 1001.6859999999999, "text": "I don't want to interrupt, but you are cordially invited to prevent a disaster."}, {"start": 1001.6859999999999, "end": 1004.6859999999999, "text": "I promised to play your dreams before mine."}, {"start": 1004.6859999999999, "end": 1007.6859999999999, "text": "I promised to bottle up my repulsion at the sight of your hair in the drain."}, {"start": 1007.6859999999999, "end": 1012.6859999999999, "text": "I promised to earn no more than 70% of what you would make at the same job."}, {"start": 1012.6859999999999, "end": 1013.6859999999999, "text": "What about babies?"}, {"start": 1013.6859999999999, "end": 1014.6859999999999, "text": "What about 'em?"}, {"start": 1014.6859999999999, "end": 1015.6859999999999, "text": "How many?"}, {"start": 1015.6859999999999, "end": 1016.6859999999999, "text": "Pick a number dick like it's up to me."}, {"start": 1016.6859999999999, "end": 1018.6859999999999, "text": "What in God's name are you two doing?"}, {"start": 1018.6859999999999, "end": 1019.6271764705882, "text": "Getting married?"}, {"start": 1019.6271764705882, "end": 1021.6859999999999, "text": "What does it look like we're doing?"}, {"start": 1021.6859999999999, "end": 1023.0799393939393, "text": "You two are damn fools."}, {"start": 1023.0799393939393, "end": 1023.6859999999999, "text": "Oh, sorry."}, {"start": 1023.6859999999999, "end": 1024.686, "text": "I'll allow it."}, {"start": 1024.686, "end": 1025.5431428571428, "text": "I am a fool."}, {"start": 1025.5431428571428, "end": 1026.4717142857141, "text": "I was a fool."}, {"start": 1026.4717142857141, "end": 1029.686, "text": "I think I wasn't destined for a life of this."}, {"start": 1029.686, "end": 1031.0585490196077, "text": "I mean, look around."}, {"start": 1031.0585490196077, "end": 1036.686, "text": "Can you even imagine what kind of wedding I could throw if I actually gave a crap?"}, {"start": 1036.686, "end": 1037.686, "text": "No offense."}, {"start": 1037.686, "end": 1038.2431428571429, "text": "Knock it off."}, {"start": 1038.2431428571429, "end": 1040.686, "text": "Being good at weddings doesn't make you good at marriage."}, {"start": 1040.686, "end": 1041.1126666666667, "text": "Exactly."}, {"start": 1041.1126666666667, "end": 1044.686, "text": "People can make all sorts of promises, but they never stick it out."}, {"start": 1044.686, "end": 1046.733619047619, "text": "It's not something you just stick out, man."}, {"start": 1046.733619047619, "end": 1047.0193333333332, "text": "Right?"}, {"start": 1047.0193333333332, "end": 1048.686, "text": "It's a risk that you take together."}, {"start": 1048.686, "end": 1050.276909090909, "text": "And you don't just promise it once."}, {"start": 1050.276909090909, "end": 1051.686, "text": "You gotta promise it every day."}, {"start": 1051.686, "end": 1054.5697209302325, "text": "Yes, but the person you're making promises to is gonna change."}, {"start": 1054.5697209302325, "end": 1055.686, "text": "You have to accept that."}, {"start": 1055.686, "end": 1055.990347826087, "text": "I do."}, {"start": 1055.990347826087, "end": 1059.5207826086955, "text": "But do you promise to be patient when that person's stereo"}, {"start": 1059.5207826086955, "end": 1062.686, "text": "business takes a little while to get off the ground?"}, {"start": 1062.686, "end": 1065.8886143790849, "text": "I do, but do you accept that ten years is more than a little while and"}, {"start": 1065.8886143790849, "end": 1069.686, "text": "the iPods aren't going away and maybe it's time to let somebody else take the lead."}, {"start": 1072.324, "end": 1073.324, "text": "I do."}, {"start": 1073.324, "end": 1074.324, "text": "You do?"}, {"start": 1074.324, "end": 1074.7855384615386, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 1074.7855384615386, "end": 1077.324, "text": "Maybe I'll swear I do."}, {"start": 1077.324, "end": 1082.324, "text": "Then I promise I will do whatever it takes to make this work forever."}, {"start": 1082.324, "end": 1086.324, "text": "Well, in that case, let's rehearse this bad boy."}, {"start": 1086.324, "end": 1088.9906666666668, "text": "Actually, you pretty much just married each other."}, {"start": 1088.9906666666668, "end": 1091.604, "text": "If you let me pronounce you man and wife, you can"}, {"start": 1091.604, "end": 1094.324, "text": "kiss the bride and you can save like, uh, 70 bucks."}, {"start": 1094.324, "end": 1095.324, "text": "What do you say, babe?"}, {"start": 1095.324, "end": 1096.324, "text": "Mm."}, {"start": 1096.324, "end": 1097.324, "text": "Mm-hmm."}, {"start": 1097.324, "end": 1098.3828235294118, "text": "Dog and end."}, {"start": 1098.3828235294118, "end": 1100.324, "text": "Dog, husband and wife."}, {"start": 1100.324, "end": 1102.7240000000002, "text": "Now, how about it?"}, {"start": 1102.7240000000002, "end": 1104.324, "text": "Let's party!"}, {"start": 1107.324, "end": 1108.324, "text": "Wang."}, {"start": 1125.324, "end": 1126.324, "text": "Abed."}, {"start": 1126.324, "end": 1126.6431489361703, "text": "Abed."}, {"start": 1126.6431489361703, "end": 1126.9622978723405, "text": "Abed."}, {"start": 1126.9622978723405, "end": 1127.2814468085107, "text": "Abed."}, {"start": 1127.2814468085107, "end": 1128.0474042553192, "text": "We're weird."}, {"start": 1128.0474042553192, "end": 1129.324, "text": "We need to be weird."}, {"start": 1129.324, "end": 1130.6463140495869, "text": "You want to see something weird?"}, {"start": 1130.6463140495869, "end": 1131.5140826446282, "text": "Check out this dance."}, {"start": 1131.5140826446282, "end": 1132.4644958677686, "text": "What did you call this?"}, {"start": 1132.4644958677686, "end": 1133.2082975206613, "text": "The Lindberg Lean?"}, {"start": 1133.2082975206613, "end": 1134.324, "text": "What do they think of next?"}, {"start": 1138.324, "end": 1140.324, "text": "Inspector, space time."}, {"start": 1140.324, "end": 1144.324, "text": "Oh, thank the cosmic engineer I found you for this is hardly the time."}, {"start": 1144.324, "end": 1146.324, "text": "Or is it hardly the space?"}, {"start": 1146.324, "end": 1148.701049180328, "text": "Okay, I see what you did there, but now I have to get back"}, {"start": 1148.701049180328, "end": 1151.324, "text": "to my Lindberg Lean with, um, I'm sorry, I didn't get your name."}, {"start": 1151.324, "end": 1153.324, "text": "Inspector, what sort of creature?"}, {"start": 1153.324, "end": 1156.324, "text": "What sort of creature would do a dance called the Lindberg Lean?"}, {"start": 1158.324, "end": 1159.324, "text": "Blorgans?"}, {"start": 1159.324, "end": 1160.324, "text": "Blorgans."}, {"start": 1160.324, "end": 1162.324, "text": "My name's Danielle."}, {"start": 1162.324, "end": 1163.3010114942529, "text": "Constable Reggie."}, {"start": 1163.3010114942529, "end": 1167.324, "text": "It appears the Blorgans have developed the ability to take human form."}, {"start": 1167.324, "end": 1168.324, "text": "Weirdos."}, {"start": 1170.324, "end": 1172.324, "text": "Your photonic Ola hat."}, {"start": 1177.324, "end": 1178.3674782608696, "text": "Long on patrol."}, {"start": 1178.3674782608696, "end": 1181.4979130434783, "text": "Surely, I'd have some good news and bad news."}, {"start": 1181.4979130434783, "end": 1185.324, "text": "The good news is the board loved your sandwich shop ID."}, {"start": 1186.324, "end": 1188.0651764705883, "text": "The bad news is they made a few calls"}, {"start": 1188.0651764705883, "end": 1190.324, "text": "and sold the space to Subway the sandwich place."}, {"start": 1190.324, "end": 1191.324, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 1191.324, "end": 1193.1573333333333, "text": "Yes, and I put a lot of work into that idea."}, {"start": 1193.1573333333333, "end": 1194.324, "text": "How could you do this, Dean?"}, {"start": 1194.324, "end": 1194.8368205128206, "text": "I'm sorry."}, {"start": 1194.8368205128206, "end": 1198.6829743589744, "text": "The board went over my head on this one, and I don't remember being invited"}, {"start": 1198.6829743589744, "end": 1202.324, "text": "to your wedding, so I guess we're even on the hurting each other front."}, {"start": 1203.324, "end": 1205.324, "text": "I'm a blast at weddings."}, {"start": 1207.324, "end": 1208.324, "text": "Here go all my dreams."}, {"start": 1208.324, "end": 1209.601777777778, "text": "This is just a setback."}, {"start": 1209.601777777778, "end": 1212.324, "text": "You don't have to give up just because of Subway."}, {"start": 1212.324, "end": 1214.3802500000002, "text": "I guess I'd better go break the news to Pierce."}, {"start": 1214.3802500000002, "end": 1215.4740000000002, "text": "He's not gonna like this."}, {"start": 1215.4740000000002, "end": 1217.5302500000003, "text": "Remember that temper tantrum he threw when Adam"}, {"start": 1217.5302500000003, "end": 1219.324, "text": "Sandler stole his idea for Jack and Jill?"}, {"start": 1219.324, "end": 1220.4608421052633, "text": "You're underestimating him."}, {"start": 1220.4608421052633, "end": 1223.324, "text": "I think Pierce is a lot more mature than we all give him credit for."}, {"start": 1224.324, "end": 1226.1906666666666, "text": "Look at me now, Dad."}, {"start": 1226.1906666666666, "end": 1227.7773333333332, "text": "How's your taste?"}, {"start": 1227.7773333333332, "end": 1231.324, "text": "How many sandwich places did you have?"}, {"start": 1232.324, "end": 1233.414909090909, "text": "Ha ha!"}, {"start": 1233.414909090909, "end": 1234.324, "text": "None!"}, {"start": 1238.324, "end": 1239.324, "text": "[door opens]"}, {"start": 1268.324, "end": 1269.324, "text": "[footsteps]"}]}